# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 1: INTRO & OPENING PATH
# ==============================================================================
~ start
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Isaac: *His head consists of a giant spherical cluster of dozens of un-blinking ocular eyes, glowing halo hovering softly as white wings rustle.*
Isaac: *His chiseled, perfectly symmetrical muscular physique is clad in dark athletic gym shorts, sitting at a precise ninety-degree angle.*
Isaac: *Vocal cords chime with soft, multi-harmonic metallic chords.*
Isaac: Welcome, suitor. Your posture and vector placement are remarkably well-balanced tonight.

- "Your symmetry and presence are breathtaking."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 8)
	if GameManager.get_affection("angel") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Isaac: *His golden halo brightens, dozens of ocular pupils dilating in romantic harmony.*
		Isaac: Ah... fifty-fifty emotional alignment! You speak straight to my celestial core...
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Isaac: *Multi-harmonic chime resonates cheerfully as his wings fold neatly.*
		Isaac: Thank you, suitor. Flawless symmetry is the ultimate expression of beauty.
	=> hub_part_1

- "I noticed your ocular eye cluster scanning."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Isaac: *Dozens of eyes shift in perfect unison, calculating real-time room vectors.*
	Isaac: A keen observation! Real-time vector scanning ensures absolute spatial harmony.
	=> hub_part_1

- "Do you always sit at such a rigid right angle?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -10)
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Isaac: *Vocal tone shifts to a low dissonant hum, halo flickering.*
	Isaac: Slouching causes ninety percent spinal imbalance, suitor. Order is not rigidity.
	=> hub_part_1

- "You look terrifying. I don't trust eye clusters."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -20)
	if GameManager.get_affection("angel") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Isaac: *Dozens of pupils lock onto you simultaneously, halo blazing with harsh light.*
		Isaac: Mind your chaotic tongue, suitor, before I realign your spatial coordinates.
		=> hub_part_1

