- "What are your hopes after leaving Blackwood?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_b")]
	=> p1_topic_b

- "Do you ever mind a little room clutter?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_c")]
